  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_glovers_shreds_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>shreds of glove-leather used to make size, a semi-solid glutinous substance, prepared from materials similar to those which furnish glue, and used to mix with colors, to dress cloth or paper, and for various other purposes (OED s.v. glover c &amp; size n.2 2)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
